    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Frame Machina - OcularZero</strong>, your <strong>Frame\u2019s ocular vision is damaged</strong>\u00a0your only sight is the minimap. Ambushed and outnumbered, you must rely on instinct, precision, and awareness to survive an onslaught of relentless enemies. This is pure, high-speed arcade survival. No upgrades, no second chances, just you, your Frame, and the fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blind Combat, Pure Instinct\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With your Frame\u2019s vision systems down, you can only perceive the battlefield through the minimap.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High-Speed, Precision Action</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Responsive controls let you weave through incoming fire, strafe past threats, and unleash devastation in every direction.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relentless, Unforgiving Ambush</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Waves of enemies will hunt you down with aggression. There\u2019s no escape only survival for as long as you can hold out.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No hand-holding. No mercy. Just pure skill. <strong>How long can you survive?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Frame Machina - OcularZero</strong>, your <strong>Frame\u2019s ocular vision is damaged</strong>\u00a0your only sight is the minimap. Ambushed and outnumbered, you must rely on instinct, precision, and awareness to survive an onslaught of relentless enemies. This is pure, high-speed arcade survival. No upgrades, no second chances, just you, your Frame, and the fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blind Combat, Pure Instinct\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With your Frame\u2019s vision systems down, you can only perceive the battlefield through the minimap.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High-Speed, Precision Action</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Responsive controls let you weave through incoming fire, strafe past threats, and unleash devastation in every direction.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relentless, Unforgiving Ambush</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Waves of enemies will hunt you down with aggression. There\u2019s no escape only survival for as long as you can hold out.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No hand-holding. No mercy. Just pure skill. <strong>How long can you survive?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
